            <title>[IGNITE-9945] Entry start version omits datecenter id.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9945</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Now, entry start version has datacenterID=0&#160;and such entry can be treated as recieved from foreign DC. This may cause false positive DR conflict and force user to make non-trivial additional check.&lt;/p&gt;


